      "values:originalText": "After “services” (last occurring), insert “in trade or commerce”.\n\nCartels  Schedule 2\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 114, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017",
      "skos:definition": "After “services” (last occurring), insert “in trade or commerce”.\n\nCartels  Schedule 2\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 114, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017",
