      "values:originalText": "Omit “contract containing a cartel provision if”, substitute “contract,\narrangement or understanding containing a cartel provision if the\ndefendant proves that”.",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “contract containing a cartel provision if”, substitute “contract,\narrangement or understanding containing a cartel provision if the\ndefendant proves that”.",
