      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "Omit all the words from and including “(6) The” to and including “by\nway of:”, substitute:\n\n(6) This section does not apply to or in relation to the giving effect to a\nprovision of a contract, arrangement or understanding, or to or in\nrelation to engaging in a concerted practice, by way of:\n\nSchedule 3  Price signalling and concerted practices",
      "skos:definition": "Omit all the words from and including “(6) The” to and including “by\nway of:”, substitute:\n\n(6) This section does not apply to or in relation to the giving effect to a\nprovision of a contract, arrangement or understanding, or to or in\nrelation to engaging in a concerted practice, by way of:\n\nSchedule 3  Price signalling and concerted practices",
