    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-3-sec-10",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 Subsections 45(7) and (8) of Schedule 1",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-3-sec-10"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\n\n(7) This section does not apply to or in relation to:\n\n(a) a contract, arrangement or understanding to the extent that\nthe contract, arrangement or understanding directly or\nindirectly provides for; or\n\n(b) a proposed contract, arrangement or understanding to the\nextent that the proposed contract, arrangement or\nunderstanding would directly or indirectly provide for; or\n\n(c) a concerted practice to the extent that the practice directly or\nindirectly involves;\nthe acquisition of any shares in the capital of a body corporate or\nany assets of a person.\n\n(8) This section does not apply to or in relation to:\n\n(a) a contract, arrangement or understanding, or\n\n(b) a proposed contract, arrangement or understanding; or\n\n(c) a concerted practice;\nthe only parties to which are or would be bodies corporate that are\nrelated to each other.\n\n(8AA) This section does not apply to or in relation to a concerted practice\nif the only persons engaging in it are or would be:\n\n(a) the Crown in right of the Commonwealth and one or more\nauthorities of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(b) the Crown in right of a State or Territory and one or more\nauthorities of that State or Territory.\n\nPrice signalling and concerted practices  Schedule 3\nOther amendments  Part 2\n\nNo. 114, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\n\n(7) This section does not apply to or in relation to:\n\n(a) a contract, arrangement or understanding to the extent that\nthe contract, arrangement or understanding directly or\nindirectly provides for; or\n\n(b) a proposed contract, arrangement or understanding to the\nextent that the proposed contract, arrangement or\nunderstanding would directly or indirectly provide for; or\n\n(c) a concerted practice to the extent that the practice directly or\nindirectly involves;\nthe acquisition of any shares in the capital of a body corporate or\nany assets of a person.\n\n(8) This section does not apply to or in relation to:\n\n(a) a contract, arrangement or understanding, or\n\n(b) a proposed contract, arrangement or understanding; or\n\n(c) a concerted practice;\nthe only parties to which are or would be bodies corporate that are\nrelated to each other.\n\n(8AA) This section does not apply to or in relation to a concerted practice\nif the only persons engaging in it are or would be:\n\n(a) the Crown in right of the Commonwealth and one or more\nauthorities of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(b) the Crown in right of a State or Territory and one or more\nauthorities of that State or Territory.\n\nPrice signalling and concerted practices  Schedule 3\nOther amendments  Part 2\n\nNo. 114, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-3-sec-10-ss-7"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-3-sec-10-ss-8"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "45006b563b2fa2182b7ea81cca2aac16faa404d7946d1c0f51f91fbff6cf069d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-3-sec-10",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 Subsections 45(7) and (8) of Schedule 1",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\n\n(7) This section does not apply to or in relation to:\n\n(a) a contract, arrangement or understanding to the extent that\nthe contract, arrangement or understanding directly or\nindirectly provides for; or\n\n(b) a proposed contract, arrangement or understanding to the\nextent that the proposed contract, arrangement or\nunderstanding would directly or indirectly provide for; or\n\n(c) a concerted practice to the extent that the practice directly or\nindirectly involves;\nthe acquisition of any shares in the capital of a body corporate or\nany assets of a person.\n\n(8) This section does not apply to or in relation to:\n\n(a) a contract, arrangement or understanding, or\n\n(b) a proposed contract, arrangement or understanding; or\n\n(c) a concerted practice;\nthe only parties to which are or would be bodies corporate that are\nrelated to each other.\n\n(8AA) This section does not apply to or in relation to a concerted practice\nif the only persons engaging in it are or would be:\n\n(a) the Crown in right of the Commonwealth and one or more\nauthorities of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(b) the Crown in right of a State or Territory and one or more\nauthorities of that State or Territory.\n\nPrice signalling and concerted practices  Schedule 3\nOther amendments  Part 2\n\nNo. 114, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017"
    },
