      "skos:prefLabel": "10(8) Subsections 45(7) and (8) of Schedule 1",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-3-sec-10-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(8) This section does not apply to or in relation to:\n\n(a) a contract, arrangement or understanding, or\n\n(b) a proposed contract, arrangement or understanding; or\n\n(c) a concerted practice;\nthe only parties to which are or would be bodies corporate that are\nrelated to each other.\n\n(8AA) This section does not apply to or in relation to a concerted practice\nif the only persons engaging in it are or would be:\n\n(a) the Crown in right of the Commonwealth and one or more\nauthorities of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(b) the Crown in right of a State or Territory and one or more\nauthorities of that State or Territory.\n\nPrice signalling and concerted practices  Schedule 3\nOther amendments  Part 2\n\nNo. 114, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017",
      "skos:definition": "(8) This section does not apply to or in relation to:\n\n(a) a contract, arrangement or understanding, or\n\n(b) a proposed contract, arrangement or understanding; or\n\n(c) a concerted practice;\nthe only parties to which are or would be bodies corporate that are\nrelated to each other.\n\n(8AA) This section does not apply to or in relation to a concerted practice\nif the only persons engaging in it are or would be:\n\n(a) the Crown in right of the Commonwealth and one or more\nauthorities of the Commonwealth; or\n\n(b) the Crown in right of a State or Territory and one or more\nauthorities of that State or Territory.\n\nPrice signalling and concerted practices  Schedule 3\nOther amendments  Part 2\n\nNo. 114, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-3-sec-10"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
