      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(2AA) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(g), the particulars to be given to\nthe Commission:\n\n(a) need not include particulars of prices for the goods or\nservices; but\n\n(b) must include particulars of any method of fixing, controlling\nor maintaining such prices.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(2AA) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(g), the particulars to be given to\nthe Commission:\n\n(a) need not include particulars of prices for the goods or\nservices; but\n\n(b) must include particulars of any method of fixing, controlling\nor maintaining such prices.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-3-sec-20-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-3-sec-20-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ae7d9ef329c7ad9c93fc589f6049ed06c64cb8c57da6716bc17bf4457d188be9",
      "skos:note": "Particulars of method of fixing, controlling or maintaining prices must be included.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-3-sec-20",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20 After subsection 51(2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(2AA) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(g), the particulars to be given to\nthe Commission:\n\n(a) need not include particulars of prices for the goods or\nservices; but\n\n(b) must include particulars of any method of fixing, controlling\nor maintaining such prices."
    },
