      "values:originalText": "Add “or”.\n\nPrice signalling and concerted practices  Schedule 3\nOther amendments  Part 2\n\nNo. 114, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017",
      "skos:definition": "Add “or”.\n\nPrice signalling and concerted practices  Schedule 3\nOther amendments  Part 2\n\nNo. 114, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017",
