      "values:originalText": "Omit “constituted by a corporation engaging in conduct of a kind\nreferred to in subsection (2), (3), (4) or (5) or paragraph (8)(a) or (b) or\n(9)(a), (b) or (c)”, substitute “by a corporation”.",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “constituted by a corporation engaging in conduct of a kind\nreferred to in subsection (2), (3), (4) or (5) or paragraph (8)(a) or (b) or\n(9)(a), (b) or (c)”, substitute “by a corporation”.",
