      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.39",
      "values:originalText": "After “subsection (1)”, insert “describing conduct or proposed conduct\nreferred to in subsection 47(2), (3), (4), (5), (6), (7), (8) or (9)”.",
      "skos:definition": "After “subsection (1)”, insert “describing conduct or proposed conduct\nreferred to in subsection 47(2), (3), (4), (5), (6), (7), (8) or (9)”.",
