      "cml:premiseText": "(c) there has been a material change of circumstances since:\n\n(i) if the Commission has previously given the corporation notice under this subsection in relation to the collective boycott conduct—that notice was given;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The temporal interval for the stop notice is defined by the material change of circumstances."
    },
