      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.50",
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of paragraph (5)(a), the period is:\n\n(a) the period of 90 days beginning on the day the Commission\ngives the corporation the stop notice; or\n\n(b) if the Commission extends it under subsection (7)—that\nperiod as so extended.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) For the purposes of paragraph (5)(a), the period is:\n\n(a) the period of 90 days beginning on the day the Commission\ngives the corporation the stop notice; or\n\n(b) if the Commission extends it under subsection (7)—that\nperiod as so extended.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-93ag"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-93ag-ss-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a2d73e5326981b7737180e0f790bcc176efe0b93f21a0a745f894c2c6884e641",
      "skos:note": "Defines a period for the stop notice in collective boycott conduct"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-9-sec-93ag-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "93AG(6) Stop notice for collective boycott conduct",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 50,
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of paragraph (5)(a), the period is:\n\n(a) the period of 90 days beginning on the day the Commission\ngives the corporation the stop notice; or\n\n(b) if the Commission extends it under subsection (7)—that\nperiod as so extended."
    },
