      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.50",
      "values:originalText": "(7) Before the end of the period referred to in paragraph (6)(a), the\nCommission may extend the period by up to a further 90 days:\n\n(a) if satisfied that in all the circumstances it is reasonable to do\nso; and\n\n(b) by giving written notice of the extended period to the\ncorporation.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) Before the end of the period referred to in paragraph (6)(a), the\nCommission may extend the period by up to a further 90 days:\n\n(a) if satisfied that in all the circumstances it is reasonable to do\nso; and\n\n(b) by giving written notice of the extended period to the\ncorporation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-93ag"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-93ag-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-93ag-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dda79bba5aa4688d05d22e9ae7de11a75e09ac3da8652707be854fd83a747851",
      "skos:note": "Commission may extend period of collective boycott conduct by up to 90 days with written notice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-9-sec-93ag-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "93AG(7) Stop notice for collective boycott conduct",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 50,
      "values:originalText": "(7) Before the end of the period referred to in paragraph (6)(a), the\nCommission may extend the period by up to a further 90 days:\n\n(a) if satisfied that in all the circumstances it is reasonable to do\nso; and\n\n(b) by giving written notice of the extended period to the\ncorporation."
    },
