      "values:originalText": "(8) The Commission must, in or with the notice under subsection (7),\ngive the corporation a written statement of its reasons for giving\nthe notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) The Commission must, in or with the notice under subsection (7),\ngive the corporation a written statement of its reasons for giving\nthe notice.",
