      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commission may specify in the determination any one or more\nof the following limitations:\n\n(a) a limitation to persons of a specified kind;\n\n(b) a limitation to circumstances of a specified kind;\n\n(c) a limitation to conduct that complies with specified\nconditions.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Commission may specify in the determination any one or more\nof the following limitations:\n\n(a) a limitation to persons of a specified kind;\n\n(b) a limitation to circumstances of a specified kind;\n\n(c) a limitation to conduct that complies with specified\nconditions.",
