      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.57",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the definition, substitute:\nauthorisation means an authorisation under Division 1 of Part VII\ngranted by the Commission or by the Tribunal on a review of a\ndetermination of the Commission.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the definition, substitute:\nauthorisation means an authorisation under Division 1 of Part VII\ngranted by the Commission or by the Tribunal on a review of a\ndetermination of the Commission.",
      "cml:asserts": [
