      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1AA) Without limiting paragraph (1)(a), the form may require an\napplication for a merger authorisation to contain an undertaking\nunder section 87B that the applicant will not make the acquisition\nto which the authorisation relates while the Commission is\nconsidering the application.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(1AA) Without limiting paragraph (1)(a), the form may require an\napplication for a merger authorisation to contain an undertaking\nunder section 87B that the applicant will not make the acquisition\nto which the authorisation relates while the Commission is\nconsidering the application.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-78-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-9-sec-78-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cbd88a268f2b28955f77cff7b31461018f7c00654b74928333f84850df7aa89f",
      "skos:note": "The form may require an application for a merger authorisation to contain an undertaking under section 87B."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-9-sec-78",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "78 After subsection 89(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 62,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1AA) Without limiting paragraph (1)(a), the form may require an\napplication for a merger authorisation to contain an undertaking\nunder section 87B that the applicant will not make the acquisition\nto which the authorisation relates while the Commission is\nconsidering the application."
    },
