      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “authorization”, substitute “authorisation other than a merger\nauthorisation”.\n\nAuthorisations, notifications and class exemptions  Schedule 9\nOther amendments  Part 2\n\nNo. 114, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “authorization”, substitute “authorisation other than a merger\nauthorisation”.\n\nAuthorisations, notifications and class exemptions  Schedule 9\nOther amendments  Part 2\n\nNo. 114, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017",
