      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.65",
      "values:originalText": "(3B) Subsection 90(6) (other than paragraphs 90(6)(a) and (b)) applies\nin relation to a proposal for a revocation of an authorisation in a\ncorresponding way to the way in which it applies in relation to an\napplication for an authorisation.\n\nSchedule 9  Authorisations, notifications and class exemptions",
      "skos:definition": "(3B) Subsection 90(6) (other than paragraphs 90(6)(a) and (b)) applies\nin relation to a proposal for a revocation of an authorisation in a\ncorresponding way to the way in which it applies in relation to an\napplication for an authorisation.\n\nSchedule 9  Authorisations, notifications and class exemptions",
