      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "145 At the end of section 174",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 76,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(2) A reference in this Division to subsection 88(1A) or\nparagraph 88(1A)(b) is a reference to that subsection or paragraph\nas in force before the commencement of Schedule 9 to the\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy\nReview) Act 2017."
    },
