      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 79,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The provisions of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 are:\n\n(a) section 50 and subsections 81(1) and (1A); and\n\nSchedule 9  Authorisations, notifications and class exemptions"
    },
