    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-44ca-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44CA(2) Meaning of declaration criteria",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-12-sec-44ca-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.84",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(a) if the facility is currently at capacity, and it is reasonably\npossible to expand that capacity, have regard to the facility as\nif it had that expanded capacity; and\n\n(b) without limiting paragraph (1)(b), the cost referred to in that\nparagraph includes all costs associated with having multiple\nusers of the facility (including such costs that would be\nincurred if the service is declared).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(a) if the facility is currently at capacity, and it is reasonably\npossible to expand that capacity, have regard to the facility as\nif it had that expanded capacity; and\n\n(b) without limiting paragraph (1)(b), the cost referred to in that\nparagraph includes all costs associated with having multiple\nusers of the facility (including such costs that would be\nincurred if the service is declared).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-44ca"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-44ca-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-44ca-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-44ca-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-44ca-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-44ca-ss-2-logic-argumentation-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cb0c7e6d5a861a88a3f569f85b07ebe8b7017d3b199287dbeab59566195968a9",
      "skos:note": "Consider facility expansion when determining capacity."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-12-sec-44ca-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44CA(2) Meaning of declaration criteria",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 84,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(a) if the facility is currently at capacity, and it is reasonably\npossible to expand that capacity, have regard to the facility as\nif it had that expanded capacity; and\n\n(b) without limiting paragraph (1)(b), the cost referred to in that\nparagraph includes all costs associated with having multiple\nusers of the facility (including such costs that would be\nincurred if the service is declared)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-44ca-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
