      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.86",
      "values:originalText": "(1A) If the Council decides that one or more of paragraphs (1)(a) to (e)\napply for a service mentioned in a person’s purported application\nunder that subsection, the Council must give the person written\nnotice explaining:\n\n(a) why those paragraphs apply; and\n\n(b) that such an application cannot be made for the service.",
      "skos:definition": "(1A) If the Council decides that one or more of paragraphs (1)(a) to (e)\napply for a service mentioned in a person’s purported application\nunder that subsection, the Council must give the person written\nnotice explaining:\n\n(a) why those paragraphs apply; and\n\n(b) that such an application cannot be made for the service.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-5"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-5-ss-1a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-5-ss-1a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "29771f113ec08fa1a35b92e66145c46ec0ea60ec7912f82f41b03b3b5ba8995f",
      "skos:note": "Council must give written notice explaining why certain paragraphs apply and that an application cannot be made for a service.",
      "dc:description": "written notice"
    },
    {
