      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Before considering on its own initiative whether to recommend\nthat the Commonwealth Minister revoke the decision, the Council\nmust:\n\n(a) publish, by electronic or other means, a notice to that effect;\nand\n\n(b) give a copy of the notice to:\n\n(i) the responsible Minister for the State or Territory; and\n\n(ii) the provider of the service.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Before considering on its own initiative whether to recommend\nthat the Commonwealth Minister revoke the decision, the Council\nmust:\n\n(a) publish, by electronic or other means, a notice to that effect;\nand\n\n(b) give a copy of the notice to:\n\n(i) the responsible Minister for the State or Territory; and\n\n(ii) the provider of the service.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-20"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
