        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-20-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "eba0728805471185c6821492a9c97aeaccb03fe8c9ebe41ddbec0d91cb0c9d7c",
      "skos:note": "The Council must give a copy of the notice to certain persons. Publish a notice and provide it to certain parties before considering revoking a decision.",
      "dc:description": "Notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-12-sec-20-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20(2) After Subdivision C of Division 2A of Part IIIA",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 90,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Before considering on its own initiative whether to recommend\nthat the Commonwealth Minister revoke the decision, the Council\nmust:\n\n(a) publish, by electronic or other means, a notice to that effect;\nand\n\n(b) give a copy of the notice to:\n\n(i) the responsible Minister for the State or Territory; and\n\n(ii) the provider of the service."
    },
