    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-20-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20(5) After Subdivision C of Division 2A of Part IIIA",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-12-sec-20-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In considering whether to make the recommendation, the Council\nmust consider whether it is satisfied that the regime no longer\nmeets the relevant principles, set out in the Competition Principles\nAgreement, relating to whether access regimes are effective access\nregimes, because of either or both of the following:\n\n(a) substantial changes to the regime;\n\n(b) substantial amendments of those principles.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In considering whether to make the recommendation, the Council\nmust consider whether it is satisfied that the regime no longer\nmeets the relevant principles, set out in the Competition Principles\nAgreement, relating to whether access regimes are effective access\nregimes, because of either or both of the following:\n\n(a) substantial changes to the regime;\n\n(b) substantial amendments of those principles.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-20"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-20-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-20-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ca9e881d1d6fe7ed51ea4c5e264c6d09167c6bda930ae25a468809a7282633b8",
      "skos:note": "Consider substantial changes or amendments to principles before making a recommendation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-12-sec-20-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20(5) After Subdivision C of Division 2A of Part IIIA",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 90,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In considering whether to make the recommendation, the Council\nmust consider whether it is satisfied that the regime no longer\nmeets the relevant principles, set out in the Competition Principles\nAgreement, relating to whether access regimes are effective access\nregimes, because of either or both of the following:\n\n(a) substantial changes to the regime;\n\n(b) substantial amendments of those principles."
    },
