      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(2A) Without limiting paragraph (2)(d), a requirement referred to in that\nparagraph may do either or both of the following:\n\n(a) require the provider to expand the capacity of the facility;\n\n(b) require the provider to expand the geographical reach of the\nfacility.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(2A) Without limiting paragraph (2)(d), a requirement referred to in that\nparagraph may do either or both of the following:\n\n(a) require the provider to expand the capacity of the facility;\n\n(b) require the provider to expand the geographical reach of the\nfacility.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-38-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-12-sec-38-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "29470f8dd560e2b41461e1e4d252ae55bec9c4f1422a890b71a8ce1c058fc25d",
      "skos:note": "Require provider to expand facility capacity or geographical reach."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-12-sec-38",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "38 After subsection 44V(2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(2A) Without limiting paragraph (2)(d), a requirement referred to in that\nparagraph may do either or both of the following:\n\n(a) require the provider to expand the capacity of the facility;\n\n(b) require the provider to expand the geographical reach of the\nfacility."
    },
