      "values:originalText": "After “extensions of the facility”, insert “(including expansions of the\ncapacity of the facility and expansions of the geographical reach of the\nfacility)”.",
      "skos:definition": "After “extensions of the facility”, insert “(including expansions of the\ncapacity of the facility and expansions of the geographical reach of the\nfacility)”.",
