    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-13-sec-183-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "183(2) Authorisations under section 88",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-13-sec-183-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.99",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n\n(a) a valid application for an authorisation under section 88\n(other than former subsection 88(5) or (6A)) is made before\nthe commencement time; and\n\n(b) before the commencement time, the Commission has not\nmade a determination in respect of the application under\nsubsection 90(1);\n\nSchedule 13  Application and transitional provisions\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017\nNo. 114, 2017\n\nat and after the commencement time, the application is taken to be\n(and may be dealt with as) an application made under section 88 of\nthe amended Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If:\n\n(a) a valid application for an authorisation under section 88\n(other than former subsection 88(5) or (6A)) is made before\nthe commencement time; and\n\n(b) before the commencement time, the Commission has not\nmade a determination in respect of the application under\nsubsection 90(1);\n\nSchedule 13  Application and transitional provisions\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017\nNo. 114, 2017\n\nat and after the commencement time, the application is taken to be\n(and may be dealt with as) an application made under section 88 of\nthe amended Act.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-13-sec-183"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-13-sec-183-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017-sch-13-sec-183-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2943c1dae02bfd9eb427fe3a5787917cf13fec7e09eaf7a63ab56b18fa39b9ab",
      "skos:note": "Application for authorisation under section 88 is taken to be an application made under the amended Act if made before commencement time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017#sch-13-sec-183-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "183(2) Authorisations under section 88",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 99,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n\n(a) a valid application for an authorisation under section 88\n(other than former subsection 88(5) or (6A)) is made before\nthe commencement time; and\n\n(b) before the commencement time, the Commission has not\nmade a determination in respect of the application under\nsubsection 90(1);\n\nSchedule 13  Application and transitional provisions\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review)\nAct 2017\nNo. 114, 2017\n\nat and after the commencement time, the application is taken to be\n(and may be dealt with as) an application made under section 88 of\nthe amended Act."
    },
