      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.115",
      "values:originalText": "The amendment made by Part 4 of Schedule 14 to the Competition\nand Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review) Act 2017\napplies in relation to disclosures made on or after the\ncommencement of that Part that relate to notices given on or after\nthe commencement of that Part.",
      "skos:definition": "The amendment made by Part 4 of Schedule 14 to the Competition\nand Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review) Act 2017\napplies in relation to disclosures made on or after the\ncommencement of that Part that relate to notices given on or after\nthe commencement of that Part.",
