      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-competition-policy-review-act-2017.pdf, p.115",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by Part 6 of Schedule 14 to the\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy\nReview) Act 2017 apply in relation to unsolicited consumer\nagreements made on or after the commencement of that Part.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 30 March 2017\nSenate on 6 September 2017]\n\n(66/17)",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by Part 6 of Schedule 14 to the\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy\nReview) Act 2017 apply in relation to unsolicited consumer\nagreements made on or after the commencement of that Part.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 30 March 2017\nSenate on 6 September 2017]\n\n(66/17)",
